  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "でんきを　まとって\nあいてに　ぶつかって　こうげきする。\nじぶんも　すこし　ダメージを　うける。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "전기를 두르고\n상대에게 부딪쳐 공격한다.\n자신도 조금 데미지를 입는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓電流圍繞全身，\n衝撞對手進行攻擊。\n自己也會受到少許傷害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une charge électrique violente qui blesse aussi\nlégèrement le lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender erzeugt Spannung und greift an, indem er\nauf Kollisionskurs geht. Er erleidet selbst leichten\nSchaden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Carga eléctrica muy potente que también hiere\nligeramente a quien la usa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si carica di elettricità per poi scagliarsi\nsul bersaglio, ma subisce dei danni per il contraccolpo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes\ninto its target. This also damages the user a little.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "電気を　まとって\n相手に　ぶつかって　攻撃する。\n自分も　少し　ダメージを　受ける。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让电流覆盖全身，\n撞向对手进行攻击。\n自己也会受到少许伤害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Carga eléctrica muy potente que también hiere\nligeramente a quien la usa.",
